SUMMARY:Call to Artists! Art Auction 2026
DESCRIPTION:Call to Artists! Art Auction 2026 \nIf you are a visual artist and have never participated in our annual Art Auction exhibit\, we are inviting new artists to submit images of three possible artworks to be juried into our Art Auction. Interested artists may apply by July 5 at bit.ly/penceauctionapp (free to apply). \nThis exhibit represents the work of over 100 outstanding local & regional artists\, who contribute paintings\, photography\, ceramics\, textiles\, sculpture\, mixed media work\, and more\, on display at the gallery for preview and online for silent auction bidding from September 5-26 on our Art Auction website. \nRequirements:\n– Apply by July 5 at bit.ly/penceauctionapp (free)\n– Must be new to participating in our Art Auction\n– May submit up to 3 artworks for consideration\n– Artwork must be at least 6″ in size\, no larger than 36″ wide for 2D work (including frame)\n– Retail value of $175+\n– Completed within the past 5 years\n– Framed/ready to install by August 23\n– Artists may request 0-40% back of proceeds \nArtists will be notified of their acceptance by July 8. Art Auction is our major fundraiser for the year\, providing support for our exhibits and education programs. Thank you!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/call-to-artists-art-auction-2026/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/AA_ArtistCall-SM-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencegallery@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
